# Design

Dark-only. Vercel / Next.js language: black canvas, high contrast, quiet chrome, one accent.

Use tokens from `app/globals.css` — never raw hex in components:

- `bg-background` / `text-primary` / `text-secondary` / `text-accent` / `bg-accent` / `border-border`

- Marketing object, not a dashboard. Generous type, real hierarchy, almost no chrome.
- Mobile is the default viewport.
- Verify UI in the browser before done: paste a hash, empty state, error state. Check every route that shares the state you touched. A screenshot is not verification.
